WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Unpack a native binary
Decode the UPX payload from a packed executable.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Extract indicators
Find the URL, email address, and IP address in a file.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Let Disrobe choose the recovery path
Identify the module and save its recovery reports and stages.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Decompile Lua bytecode
Recover source from a compiled Lua chunk.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Lift WebAssembly to WAT
Write the module's functions and instructions as text.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Read the recovered instructions
The exported add function retains its two inputs and i32.add instruction.
